<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CUP FINAL SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CUP FINAL SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German League Cup final summary:</p>
<p>Bayern Munich 2 (Basler 57, Elber 71) VfB Stuttgart 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance 15,000.</p>
